  "title": "GitLab CI: Run the Qt5 job on 4.6 on merge requests that change Qt",
  "description": "Since the 4.6 branch still supports Qt 5 for more platforms, and doesn't\nrequire C++14, we need to run the Qt 5 job on cherry-picks and backports\nthat run on master but might not run on 4.6 and earlier.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
